(P109 - Q5 preposition plus readiness diagnostic)
(Requires fresh Q2. Stops before every G38/raster command.)

M5
G4 P3.0
G21 G90 G94 G17 G54
M64 P0
G4 P2.0
(print,P109 start: Q5 preposition plus handshake; no Home or G38 permitted)
G53 G0 X-280.0 Y-266.0
(print,P109 preposition complete: beginning Q5 readiness handshake)
M65 P0
G4 P2.0
o109 if [#<_probe_state> NE 1]
  M64 P0
  (print,P109 READY acknowledgement missing)
  o901 error[39]
o109 endif
M64 P0
G4 P0.10
o110 if [#<_probe_state> NE 0]
  (print,P109 READY acknowledgement did not release)
  o902 error[39]
o110 endif
M65 P0
G4 P0.10
M64 P0
(print,P109 complete: Q5 preposition plus handshake passed; no G38 issued)
o109 return [1]
